<h2 style="margin:0 0 10px;
           font-family:'Orbitron','Montserrat',Arial,sans-serif;
           color:#00209F; font-size:20px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase;">
  Your BonTouris ID is Approved 🎉
</h2>

<p style="margin:0 0 14px;
          font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;
          color:#1b2559; font-size:14px; line-height:1.65;">
  Hello <strong><%= @visitor.first_name %></strong>,
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 14px;
          font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;
          color:#1b2559; font-size:14px; line-height:1.65;">
  Your <strong>BonTouris ID</strong> has been successfully reviewed and approved by <strong>Verifyem</strong>.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 14px;
          font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;
          color:#1b2559; font-size:14px; line-height:1.65;">
  You may now use your BonTouris ID for identity verification <strong>while staying in Haiti</strong>,
  with participating hotels, services, and local authorities.
</p>

<div style="margin:18px 0 14px; text-align:center;">
  <div style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:12px;
              background:#00209F; color:#ffffff;">
    <div style="font-family:'Montserrat','Inter',Arial,sans-serif;
                font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; opacity:0.9;">
      BonTouris ID
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:6px;
                font-family:'Orbitron','Montserrat',Arial,sans-serif;
                font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.10em; font-weight:800;">
      <%= @visitor.bonid %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<p style="margin:0;
          font-family:'Montserrat','Inter',Arial,sans-serif;
          color:rgba(27,37,89,0.85); font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.6;">
  Keep this reference ID for support. Your certificate & QR code are available from your secure status page.
</p>
